    "end of heading, Find yourselfin therapy, level 2",
    "paragraph",
    "BetterHelp was founded in 2013 to remove the traditional barriers to therapy and make mental health care more accessible to everyone. Today, it is the world’s largest therapy service — providing professional, affordable, and tailored therapy in a convenient online format. BetterHelp’s network of over 31,000 therapists worldwide has helped millions of people take ownership of their mental health and work towards their personal goals. As the unmet need for mental health services continues to grow, BetterHelp is committed to expanding access to therapy globally.",
    "end of paragraph",
    "graphics-document",
    "graphics-document",
    "graphics-document",
    "heading, Our therapists, level 2",
    "paragraph",
    "Every therapist providing services on BetterHelp is a qualified and experienced professional. They must also have a relevant academic degree, at least 3 years of experience, and have credentials from their professional organization where applicable. This includes completing the necessary education, exams, training, and practice requirements. We refer to therapists across our sites and apps according to their professional title and credentials, as recognized in the jurisdiction responsible for their profession.",
    "end of paragraph",
    "Use the Pause/Play rotation button to pause or start the rotating images.",
